    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινουργ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make new</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.3
			</span></i>; <i>re-create</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zos.Alch.
				p.108
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>begin something new</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί καινουργεῖς</span>; what
				<i>new plan art thou meditating</i>? <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				2
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. λόγον</span>
			<i>speak new, strange</i> words, ib.<i><span class="en">
				838
			</span></i>; <i>coin</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					439
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ κ. φέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					29
				</span></i>
			: usu. in bad sense, <i>make innovations</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.2.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.21
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καινουργούμενα</span>
			<i>all attempts at alteration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				398a35
			</span></i>.</div>
